---
import { site } from '~/config/site';
interface Props { page:'about'|'privacy-policy'|'terms-of-service'|'copyright'|'contact' }
const {page}=Astro.props;
---
{page==='about'&&<><p>{site.name} is an independent English reference for the PC digital adaptation of Frosthaven. It covers class playstyles, build strategy, campaign preparation, maps, equipment and official updates.</p><h2>How we work</h2><p>Content is maintained through the project's GitHub repository. Official digital announcements establish release and feature facts; tabletop references are identified separately. Editorial strategy is not presented as hands-on testing. See <a href="/editorial/">our sources, coverage limits and media credits</a>.</p><h2>Independence</h2><p>{site.legalNotice} The official game website is <a href={site.social.official}>playfrosthaven.com</a>. Buying the game or obtaining technical account support is handled by the developer, publisher or storefront.</p><h2>Corrections</h2><p><a href="/contact/">Report an error</a> with the affected page and the current digital game version.</p></>}
{page==='privacy-policy'&&<><p>This policy describes optional advertising and the operation of this independent static website. Updated October 16, 2026.</p><h2>Hosting and technical requests</h2><p>Cloudflare hosts this site and may process technical request information such as IP address, browser details and security events to deliver and protect the service. The wiki has no user accounts or server-side campaign progress database.</p><h2>Optional advertising</h2><p>When enabled and accepted, Adsterra advertising can make requests to advertising partners and use cookies, identifiers or similar technologies for delivery, measurement and fraud prevention. See <a href="https://adsterra.com/privacy-policy/">Adsterra's privacy policy</a>. Google AdSense is not enabled merely because its integration is available in the code; any future activation requires updated provider configuration and applicable consent controls.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>Optional advertising remains unloaded until you accept. Declining keeps optional ad frames unloaded. Open <a href="/cookies/">Cookie preferences</a> to change or withdraw your choice. Withdrawal removes ad frames and reloads the page to stop the previously loaded page context. It does not automatically delete cookies already set by third parties; manage those through your browser.</p><h2>Browser storage and search</h2><p>Your cookie choice and optional theme setting may be stored on your device. The map does not save personal campaign progress. Site search uses a downloaded local index; the wiki does not send the words you type to its own search server.</p><h2>External links</h2><p>GitHub, official game sources and advertisers operate under their own privacy terms. Public issue reports are visible to other users; do not include private account details.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For a privacy question, use the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>. Avoid posting personal identifiers in public reports.</p></>}
{page==='terms-of-service'&&<><p>Use this independent reference to support your own game decisions. Information can become outdated after patches, and current in-game descriptions take precedence over an older guide.</p><h2>Availability and accuracy</h2><p>The site is provided without guarantees of uninterrupted availability, exhaustive coverage, particular search rankings or results in a campaign. Corrections are welcome through <a href="/contact/">the issue tracker</a>.</p><h2>Advertising and links</h2><p>Advertising is labeled and subject to your optional consent choice. An advertisement is not a wiki endorsement. No purchase or ad click is required to read the guides.</p><h2>Intellectual property</h2><p>Game trademarks and artwork remain with their owners. The AnvilWiki software license does not license the game assets. See <a href="/copyright/">copyright information</a>.</p></>}
{page==='copyright'&&<><p>Frosthaven and the Frosthaven logo are trademarks or registered trademarks of Cephalofair Games, LLC. Digital game artwork and promotional materials remain the property of the respective rights holders, including Snapshot Games, Arc Games and relevant licensors.</p><h2>Illustrative game media</h2><p>Official screenshots, character artwork, icons and looping promotional videos illustrate the game discussed by the guides. Sources are recorded in <a href="/editorial/">the media credits</a>. This site does not claim an open license over these assets, and is not endorsed by the game creators.</p><h2>Website software</h2><p>This project derives from <a href="https://github.com/PNGTRID/AnvilWiki">AnvilWiki</a>. Its MIT copyright and license are retained in the repository. Game media is excluded from any assertion that the software license grants unrestricted reuse.</p><h2>Rights inquiries</h2><p>Use the <a href="/contact/">contact route</a> to identify a specific image or page and the requested correction.</p></>}
{page==='contact'&&<><p>For corrections and site questions, open an issue in <a href="https://github.com/tielidev/frosthaven-wiki/issues">the Frosthaven Wiki repository</a>. A GitHub account is needed to submit an issue. You can read the wiki without an account.</p><h2>Report a guide correction</h2><p>Include the page URL, game version, the statement that needs correction and an official source or in-game tooltip supporting the change. Do not upload private account details, credentials or complete game saves to a public issue.</p><h2>Game support</h2><p>We cannot recover game accounts, process purchases or resolve payment disputes. Use <a href="https://help.steampowered.com/en/wizard/HelpWithGame/?appid=2347080">Steam support</a> or the <a href={site.social.official}>official game website</a> for those matters.</p><h2>Privacy and rights inquiries</h2><p>Use an issue containing only the affected public URL and a brief description. Do not disclose sensitive personal information in the public tracker.</p></>}
